  {
   "id": "concept2",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "Properties of expectation"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "For constants a, b and random variables X, Y: $E(c) = c$; $E(aX) = aE(X)$; $E(aX + b) = aE(X) + b$; addition theorem $E(X + Y) = E(X) + E(Y)$; multiplication theorem $E(XY) = E(X)\\,E(Y)$ when X and Y are independent."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "E(aX + b) = aE(X) + b"
    },
    {
     "en": "E(X + Y) = E(X) + E(Y)"
    },
    {
     "en": "E(XY) = E(X)E(Y) if independent"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Expectation of a constant is the constant. E of a X plus b is a E X plus b. E of X plus Y is E X plus E Y, and for independent variables E of X Y is E X times E Y.",
    "kn": "ಸ್ಥಿರಾಂಕದ ನಿರೀಕ್ಷೆ ಅದೇ ಸ್ಥಿರಾಂಕ. E(aX + b) = aE(X) + b. E(X + Y) = E(X) + E(Y); ಸ್ವತಂತ್ರ ಚರಗಳಿಗೆ E(XY) = E(X)E(Y)."
   },
   "formula": "E(aX + b) = aE(X) + b"
  },
